vars: {
  d2-config: {
    layout-engine: elk
  }
}

direction: down

title: |md
  ## BPF_MAP_TYPE_HASH 内部结构
| {near: top-center; shape: text}

key: "键（PID = 13421）" {shape: parallelogram; style.fill: "#dbeafe"}
hash: "jhash(key)" {shape: hexagon; style.fill: "#fef3c7"}
buckets: "buckets[]\n（大小为 2 的幂，\n由 max_entries\n向上取整）" {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: "#f9fafb"
  b0: "bucket[0]" {shape: rectangle}
  b1: "bucket[1]" {shape: rectangle}
  bN: "bucket[N]\n（hash 对 size 取模）" {shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#fef3c7"}
  bM: "bucket[M]" {shape: rectangle}
  b0 -> b1 -> bN -> bM
}

bucket_chain: "该桶的 hlist\n（链表）" {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: "#fef3c7"
  e0: "{ key=8888, val=2 }" {shape: rectangle}
  e1: "{ key=13421, val=5 }" {shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#dcfce7"}
  e2: "{ key=99999, val=1 }" {shape: rectangle}
  e0 -> e1 -> e2: "next"
}

found: "值指针\n→ &val（就地，\n实时映射内存）" {shape: oval; style.fill: "#dcfce7"}

key -> hash -> buckets.bN
buckets.bN -> bucket_chain: "遍历链，\n比较键"
bucket_chain.e1 -> found: "匹配"

note: |md
  - **键 + 值**以*副本*形式存于映射中；\
    查找返回指向映射内存的指针。
  - **原子性**：对值指针执行 `__sync_fetch_and_add`\
    = 原子更新。无需加锁，不会发生竞态。
  - **`max_entries`** 限制元素数量；映射已满时，\
    `bpf_map_update_elem` 返回 `-E2BIG`。
  - **`BPF_MAP_TYPE_PERCPU_HASH`** 结构相同，\
    但值按 CPU 分开——无需原子操作。
| {near: bottom-center; shape: text}
